WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.340
- It is so nice to meet you.

00:00:01.340 --> 00:00:02.550
- It's great to meet you too.

00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:04.100
I'm such a huge fan.

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:04.933
- I am as well.

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.449
I'm so excited for you
congrats on "In The Heights".

00:00:06.449 --> 00:00:07.680
- Thank you, thank you.

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:09.900
- I heard that Lin actually
called you personally.

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:10.733
- Yes.

00:00:10.733 --> 00:00:11.940
- Yeah, how was that like?

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:13.890
- That was incredible.

00:00:13.890 --> 00:00:14.810
It was a shock

00:00:14.810 --> 00:00:19.810
because I got the call from
a random, like 917 number,

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:22.170
and it was actually
the day of my birthday.

00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:23.610
So I was, you know, on your birthday

00:00:23.610 --> 00:00:27.360
you get calls maybe from
people (indistinct) your phone.

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:28.490
My mom was doing my hair.

00:00:28.490 --> 00:00:30.490
And I was like I'll get back to this.

00:00:30.490 --> 00:00:31.470
It was a FaceTime.

00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:34.047
And then the same number
texts me and was like,

00:00:34.047 --> 00:00:35.650
"Hey, it's Lin, can you
pick up real quick?"

00:00:35.650 --> 00:00:37.690
And I was like, "Mom,
what I'm gonna tell him?

00:00:37.690 --> 00:00:38.870
Wait for 10 minutes?

00:00:38.870 --> 00:00:41.060
Like, he's gonna have
to see me like this."

00:00:41.060 --> 00:00:41.893
So I picked up.

00:00:41.893 --> 00:00:43.520
He had no idea it was my birthday.

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:45.490
And he was calling me to let me know

00:00:45.490 --> 00:00:49.170
that I got the role for
Nina "In The Heights".

00:00:49.170 --> 00:00:52.490
- What an amazing thing on your birthday?

00:00:52.490 --> 00:00:54.890
- Yeah, it was like the best birthday gift

00:00:54.890 --> 00:00:56.450
I've ever received,

00:00:56.450 --> 00:00:58.380
I think probably will receive.

00:00:58.380 --> 00:01:01.106
- Well you sent us a video of
that call, so let's see it.

00:01:01.106 --> 00:01:02.346
- Yeah.

00:01:02.346 --> 00:01:04.425
- [Lin] Celebrate tonight
(speaks in foreign language).

00:01:04.425 --> 00:01:05.597
- Yes.
(laughing)

00:01:05.597 --> 00:01:08.453
Thank you for telling mum
to put the iron towel.

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:12.316
She definitely would have
turned the hell out of my head.

00:01:12.316 --> 00:01:13.470
(speaks in foreign language)

00:01:13.470 --> 00:01:15.710
Thank you so much.
(mumbling)

00:01:15.710 --> 00:01:18.527
I'll see you in Washington
in "In The Heights".

00:01:18.527 --> 00:01:20.405
Bye my love, enjoy.

00:01:20.405 --> 00:01:22.770
(audience clapping)
- Oh my God, it's so crazy.

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.943
What a cool thing to have?

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:28.150
- It was like one of the best moments.

00:01:28.150 --> 00:01:31.510
Also it was really full circle
just to have my mum there.

00:01:31.510 --> 00:01:33.170
She was doing my hair

00:01:33.170 --> 00:01:35.060
and one of my best friends was there.

00:01:35.060 --> 00:01:38.510
My cousin who did my first ever read

00:01:38.510 --> 00:01:41.360
before I was any good at acting with

00:01:41.360 --> 00:01:44.260
he was there and we were just balling.

00:01:44.260 --> 00:01:45.840
- Oh, see, I don't believe in coincidence.

00:01:45.840 --> 00:01:46.673
I think it was supposed to happen

00:01:46.673 --> 00:01:47.540
like everything that was for you.

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:48.373
- Definitely.

00:01:48.373 --> 00:01:49.250
- That's so cool.

00:01:49.250 --> 00:01:51.620
What a cool memory to keep
with you forever, God.

00:01:51.620 --> 00:01:52.453
- That's beautiful.

00:01:52.453 --> 00:01:54.320
- Well the movie is about
embracing your differences.

00:01:54.320 --> 00:01:56.130
So how do you relate to that?

00:01:56.130 --> 00:02:00.820
- Oh man, I definitely
grew up in a household

00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:03.700
that embraced all of our differences.

00:02:03.700 --> 00:02:05.620
My parents are both Dominican.

00:02:05.620 --> 00:02:08.380
I'm the youngest of seven
where like a Brady bunch fam.

00:02:08.380 --> 00:02:09.878
Yeah, we're a big family.

00:02:09.878 --> 00:02:12.390
So I got siblings from both sides.

00:02:12.390 --> 00:02:14.680
And then the youngest two including myself

00:02:14.680 --> 00:02:15.940
are from both my parents.

00:02:15.940 --> 00:02:20.650
But it was a little bit different
when we moved to Florida.

00:02:20.650 --> 00:02:23.350
I was raised in New York till I was 10

00:02:23.350 --> 00:02:26.240
then we moved to Florida
and my big curly hair

00:02:26.240 --> 00:02:29.510
and being Afro-Latino was kind of a shock

00:02:29.510 --> 00:02:32.770
that I didn't realize
would be for some people

00:02:32.770 --> 00:02:34.730
once I moved to a place where
there weren't a lot of people

00:02:34.730 --> 00:02:35.700
that look like me.

00:02:35.700 --> 00:02:39.360
And so being able to
even just do a project

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:43.276
like "In The Heights"
and feel fully accepted

00:02:43.276 --> 00:02:46.620
and even learn how to
celebrate where I'm from

00:02:46.620 --> 00:02:50.060
more through the plot of our movie

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:51.180
was such a beautiful thing

00:02:51.180 --> 00:02:53.350
and it's something that
we don't always get to see

00:02:53.350 --> 00:02:54.183
in Hollywood.

00:02:54.183 --> 00:02:56.380
And it's something that we
don't always get to experience

00:02:56.380 --> 00:03:00.300
in playing a role in a film or in a show.

00:03:00.300 --> 00:03:03.904
So it was beautiful on my
first experience as an actress

00:03:03.904 --> 00:03:05.450
to experience that.

00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:08.640
- Yeah, I can't even imagine
just as an artist in general

00:03:08.640 --> 00:03:10.600
to get to do something
that also has a message

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:12.220
that means so much to you
that you can relate to.

00:03:12.220 --> 00:03:13.070
That's the coolest thing,

00:03:13.070 --> 00:03:14.940
you're getting to do something
you love and your passion,

00:03:14.940 --> 00:03:16.360
but also it's like leaving behind

00:03:16.360 --> 00:03:17.500
really positive footprints.

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:18.907
- Yeah.
- I love that.

